      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah it's been like this for a while now (many many months). I've experienced it myself in the murder 4 map by jar. Kinda trippy when stuff gets overwritten in the instance as this stays there as long as the instance lives.\nA temporary, serverside prevention as a mapmaker would be to have a loop overwrite the station ids every few minutes so no harm can be done permanently.\nBut i heard some people are able to replace more assets in a world than just the station scripts avtr_id, havent seen this yet though.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
