      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This has been a problem for quite a while. Only reason why I rarely run into the problem is because I have my own avatars but its still a big issue. And its pretty bad that certain clients can just change the Avatar Ids on the Pedestals to whatever they want. I'm a huge supporter of people modding vrchat but when stuff like this happens its really hard to convince people on the benefits of modded clients. These are the people that make us look bad.",
      "viewerReactions": null
