      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Oh... I think I remember seeing someone change the pedestal in the hub world. It seems to be a stream injection as only those who were present when it was set had the altered response. Players who entered later had the correct pedestal.\nSomething similar also let some people change whose uploaded avatars they saw in their menu.\nApparently they can pretend to be a different person through the avatar upload list, browse that other person’s uploads, then splice the avatar from that list into a pedestal for use.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
